ok   new writes the app skeleton and returns the created paths
ok   spin.toml names the package and references the framework
ok   config/routes.rb and db/schema.rb are empty DSL blocks
ok   bin/blog.rb is the app's one binary: server, migrate, db
ok   bin/gen.rb drives the generator
ok   bin/db.rb runs migrations in development without the app's models
ok   the layout renders csrf_meta_tags, the flash and yield
ok   application_controller.rb and config/app.rb are ready to edit
ok   README.md gives the cybertrain command sequence
ok   the Dockerfile builds dist/ in the image and runs it on 0.0.0.0:3000
ok   config/deploy.yml and .kamal/secrets configure Kamal for the app
ok   .github/workflows/ci.yml sets up the toolchain and runs the app's checks
